{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-touch-attribution","title":"多触点归因与 Last-click 争议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/tracking-attribution/multi-touch-attribution","wordCount":2706,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多触点归因与-last-click-争议\">多触点归因与 Last-click 争议</h1><p>同一个用户在一周内被四个联盟客碰过：周一看了测评博客，周三点了优惠站，周五刷到达人短视频，周日直接搜品牌名下单。Last-click 会把全部佣金给周日那次搜索——如果那次搜索恰好也带联盟参数的话。四个联盟客里三个白干，一个拿走全部，而真正促成决策的那次曝光可能根本没被算进去。这不是算法精度问题，而是<strong>分配规则本身是否公平</strong>的问题，而分配规则直接决定了供给侧愿不愿意继续投入。</p>\n<p>本篇讲分配规则：当一笔转化有多个候选触点时，怎么切这份佣金。单个点击如何被判定有效、窗口如何过滤见 <a href=\"click-attribution-window\">点击归因与转化窗口</a>；多个联盟网络并行时的重复计数见本篇后半部分；结算时怎么把分配结果变成钱见 <a href=\"../settlement-fraud/affiliate-settlement\">佣金结算与退货扣回</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五种规则式模型及其失效方式\">核心概念：五种规则式模型及其失效方式</h2><p>规则式归因模型不需要数据训练，按位置或时间分配权重：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>权重规则</th>\n<th>奖励什么</th>\n<th>失效方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Last-click</td>\n<td>末次触点得 1</td>\n<td>临门一脚</td>\n<td>忽略上游种草，激励劫持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First-click</td>\n<td>首次触点得 1</td>\n<td>拉新入口</td>\n<td>忽略转化促成，激励无效曝光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>所有触点均分</td>\n<td>全链路参与</td>\n<td>无差别，激励刷触点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time-decay</td>\n<td>越接近转化权重越高</td>\n<td>近期影响</td>\n<td>衰减系数难定，仍需调参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position-based</td>\n<td>首末各 40%，中间均分 20%</td>\n<td>首尾并重</td>\n<td>中间触点被系统性低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Last non-direct</td>\n<td>末次<strong>非直接访问</strong>触点</td>\n<td>兼顾直接访问</td>\n<td>只是把问题挪一格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以末次触点为例，如果触点序列是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1, c_2, c_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（时间升序），则权重向量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0, 0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；线性是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1/3, 1/3, 1/3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；时间衰减（半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>）是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{2^{-\\Delta t_i / \\tau}}{\\sum_j 2^{-\\Delta t_j / \\tau}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7209em;vertical-align:-1.1559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2799em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8301em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>时间衰减的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是最难定的参数：它既要反映决策周期，又要防止把三个月前的一次曝光和昨天的点击算成同一量级。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 常按品类设置（快消 1–3 天，大件家电 7–14 天），且需要与 <a href=\"click-attribution-window\">点击归因与转化窗口</a> 里的窗口长度协调——权重衰减的边界不应该超出窗口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[触点序列 c1..cn] --&gt; B{选择模型}&#10;  B --&gt;|规则式| C[按位置/时间分配权重]&#10;  B --&gt;|数据驱动| D[按路径历史估贡献]&#10;  C --&gt; E[权重向量 w1..wn]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[约束检查&lt;br/&gt;Σw=1, 窗口内]&#10;  F --&gt; G{同一联盟客多触点?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[合并归属于该联盟客]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[分别生成佣金记录]&#10;  H --&gt; J[佣金记录集]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[结算期汇总]&#10;  K --&gt; L[增量实验校验]&#10;  L --&gt;|偏差过大| M[重新审视模型]\">graph TD\n  A[触点序列 c1..cn] --&gt; B{选择模型}\n  B --&gt;|规则式| C[按位置/时间分配权重]\n  B --&gt;|数据驱动| D[按路径历史估贡献]\n  C --&gt; E[权重向量 w1..wn]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[约束检查&lt;br/&gt;Σw=1, 窗口内]\n  F --&gt; G{同一联盟客多触点?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[合并归属于该联盟客]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[分别生成佣金记录]\n  H --&gt; J[佣金记录集]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[结算期汇总]\n  K --&gt; L[增量实验校验]\n  L --&gt;|偏差过大| M[重新审视模型]</pre><p>图里 <code>G → H</code> 是一个必须明确的产品决策：<strong>同一个联盟客在窗口内有多次点击时，它应该拿一次佣金还是多次？</strong> 通行答案是合并为一次（取权重和），否则联盟客会通过&quot;每隔一小时再点一次&quot;来放大收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"last-click-争议的三个层次\">Last-click 争议的三个层次</h2><p>争议常被简化成&quot;Last-click 不公平&quot;，但它其实包含三个层次的问题，混在一起讨论会得出错误的修补方案。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：分配公平。</strong> Last-click 把全部功劳给末次触点，上游媒体收不到激励，长期会导致联盟生态退化成&quot;只剩优惠券站和返利站&quot;——因为这些形态天然位于漏斗末端。这一层可以用多触点模型缓解。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：归因劫持（hijacking）。</strong> 更严重的问题是末次触点本身可能是<strong>伪造的</strong>。浏览器插件、返利工具在用户已经决定购买时抢写自己的标识，它不是在影响决策，而是在拦截一笔已经发生的成交。这一层多触点模型完全无法解决——相反，多触点会让劫持者再多分到一份。识别方法见 <a href=\"../settlement-fraud/affiliate-fraud-detect\">自购作弊与虚假成交识别</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：增量性（incrementality）。</strong> 最根本的一层是：这个渠道带来的成交，有多少是<strong>本来就会发生</strong>的？哪怕分配完全公平，如果四个联盟客加起来只贡献了 5% 的增量，整个渠道的价值依然可疑。这一层只能靠实验解决，任何归因模型都回答不了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[联盟渠道 GMV] --&gt; B[归因成交额&lt;br/&gt;attributed]&#10;  A --&gt; C[增量成交额&lt;br/&gt;incremental]&#10;  B --&gt; D[错误归因部分&lt;br/&gt;人为/自然流量]&#10;  B --&gt; E[真实促成部分]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; F[基线部分&lt;br/&gt;本来会买]&#10;  D --&gt; G[归因劫持+刷单]&#10;  F --&gt; H[自然流量+老客复购]\">graph TD\n  A[联盟渠道 GMV] --&gt; B[归因成交额&lt;br/&gt;attributed]\n  A --&gt; C[增量成交额&lt;br/&gt;incremental]\n  B --&gt; D[错误归因部分&lt;br/&gt;人为/自然流量]\n  B --&gt; E[真实促成部分]\n  C --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; F[基线部分&lt;br/&gt;本来会买]\n  D --&gt; G[归因劫持+刷单]\n  F --&gt; H[自然流量+老客复购]</pre><p>这张图是判断联盟项目健康度的核心工具：<strong>理想状态是&quot;归因成交额 ≈ 增量成交额&quot;</strong>，两者的缺口由劫持与自然流量两部分组成。缺口多大算异常没有通用阈值，但趋势比绝对值有用——缺口突然扩大通常意味着出现了新的劫持形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据驱动模型-shapley-值与马尔可夫链\">数据驱动模型：Shapley 值与马尔可夫链</h2><p>规则式模型的参数靠拍脑袋，数据驱动模型从历史路径里估计贡献。两条主流路线：</p>\n<p><strong>Shapley 值</strong>来自合作博弈论，把每个触点当作一个合作者，通过计算&quot;加入该触点后边际贡献的期望值&quot;来分配总价值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{i\\}} \\frac{|S|!\\,(|N|-|S|-1)!}{|N|!}\\left[v(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - v(S)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的计算量随触点数量指数增长，所以实际实现用蒙特卡洛采样近似。Shapley 的优点是满足一组公理化性质（对称性、有效性、可加性），能给出可解释的分配；缺点是把所有触点视为可任意组合的集合，忽略了<strong>顺序</strong>——A→B 和 B→A 在 Shapley 里是一样的，但在真实决策里不一样。</p>\n<p><strong>马尔可夫链</strong>保留顺序：把触点序列建成状态转移图，用移除某个触点后转化率的下降幅度衡量其贡献（removal effect）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>contribution</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>without </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{contribution}_i = 1 - \\frac{P(\\text{convert} \\mid \\text{without } i)}{P(\\text{convert})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">contribution</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">without </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现上通常训练两条链——一条含全部触点，一条移除目标触点，比较吸收态概率。它保留了顺序信息，但对数据量要求高，长尾触点的估计方差很大。</p>\n<p>实践中的共识是：<strong>数据驱动模型用于季度级的渠道价值评估与预算重新分配，规则式模型用于逐单结算</strong>。原因很简单——逐单结算要求可解释、可申诉、可复现，Shapley 值不满足这三点；而预算决策不要求逐单可解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨网络去重-多网络并行的必然问题\">跨网络去重：多网络并行的必然问题</h2><p>当广告主同时接入多个联盟网络（或称&quot;多程序并行&quot;）时，同一个点击可能被两个网络都记录，同一笔订单可能被两个网络都认领。这不是归因模型问题，而是<strong>ID 命名空间问题</strong>。</p>\n<p>去重的正确顺序是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 订单级 click_id 唯一性</td>\n<td>订单表里的 click_id 只属于一个网络</td>\n<td>直接判定，无歧义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 时间优先</td>\n<td>多网络的点击时间取最早</td>\n<td>常见默认规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 网络优先级</td>\n<td>按合同约定的网络优先序</td>\n<td>抵消&quot;后置劫持&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 媒体级黑名单</td>\n<td>劫持特征明显的 PID 直接剔除</td>\n<td>事后补救</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>第 1 步必须成立</strong>。如果订单表里存的是&quot;网络 A 的 click_id&quot;，而网络 B 的回传要按时间窗匹配，那就永远无法做严格去重。因此推广链接链路必须支持<strong>统一 click_id 命名空间</strong>：广告主生成自己的 <code>click_id</code> 并写进所有推广链接，无论这条链接来自哪个网络；回传时把广告主的 <code>click_id</code> 与网络的 <code>click_id</code> 一并带回。这样订单上永远存着广告主的 ID，去重变成一次本地查询。链接侧的生成细节见 <a href=\"affiliate-link-param\">推广链接与追踪参数生成</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量实验-唯一能回答-值不值-的方法\">增量实验：唯一能回答&quot;值不值&quot;的方法</h2><p>归因模型分配的是<strong>功劳</strong>，实验测量的是<strong>因果</strong>。三种可用的设计：</p>\n<p><strong>地理对照（geo holdout）</strong>：在部分市场关闭联盟渠道，与相似市场对照，比较净成交差异。优点是实施干净、不受用户级干扰；缺点是需要市场可比，且切换成本高。</p>\n<p><strong>用户级对照（PSA / ghost ads）</strong>：随机把一部分用户划入对照，对对照用户不展示联盟内容（或展示但归因层置为不结算），比较两组转化率。精度高，但要求能在用户级别控制曝光，对联盟渠道往往做不到——联盟客在自己的站上做主，广告主没有控制权。</p>\n<p><strong>归因层盲测（最可行）</strong>：不改流量，只在归因层随机把一部分符合条件的转化标记为&quot;不结算&quot;，然后长期比较实验组与对照组的数据。这实际上是把佣金停掉，观察后续成交是否下降。它的干扰在于会改变联盟客的行为（它们可能因此停止投放），因此更适合短期测量而非长期运行。</p>\n<p>无论用哪种，必须遵循两个口径纪律：<strong>按毛利而非 GMV 比较</strong>，以及<strong>实验期间同步监控联盟客的投放行为是否发生变化</strong>（行为变化会污染结果）。归因层必须支持&quot;只观测不结算&quot;模式，这个开关在设计阶段就要留下——见 <a href=\"../affiliate-model/affiliate-vs-ad\">Affiliate 与站内广告/CPS 的区别</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地建议-三层口径并行\">落地建议：三层口径并行</h2><p>成熟团队不会只用一个口径，而是同时维护三层，每层用途不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结算层</td>\n<td>合同约定的规则模型（多为 last-click 或 last non-direct）</td>\n<td>逐单</td>\n<td>付钱，必须可申诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营层</td>\n<td>多触点模型（时间衰减或位置式）</td>\n<td>日/周</td>\n<td>媒体分层、费率谈判、素材建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策层</td>\n<td>增量实验结论</td>\n<td>月/季</td>\n<td>预算分配、渠道取舍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层数字不一致是正常的，危险的是<strong>没人说得清哪两个数字为什么不同</strong>。因此每一层都要能回答：&quot;这个数字用的是哪个模型、哪个窗口、哪种身份匹配等级。&quot; 归因链路里的匹配等级与窗口语义见 <a href=\"click-attribution-window\">点击归因与转化窗口</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规则式归因（last/first/linear/time-decay/position）各有系统性偏差；last-click 的争议包含分配公平、归因劫持、增量性三个层次，多触点模型只能解决第一层。</li>\n<li>数据驱动模型（Shapley 值、马尔可夫链）用于季度评估与预算决策，不适合逐单结算，因为它们不满足可解释、可申诉、可复现。</li>\n<li>同一联盟客在窗口内多次点击应合并为一次归属，否则会激励反复点击。</li>\n<li>多网络并行的去重依赖<strong>统一 click_id 命名空间</strong>，广告主必须生成并持有自己的 <code>click_id</code>，否则严格去重不可能实现。</li>\n<li>增量性只能靠实验回答：地理对照、用户级对照、归因层盲测三种设计各有适用面，且必须按毛利口径比较。</li>\n<li>建议结算层、运营层、决策层三层口径并行，每层明确模型、窗口与匹配等级，允许数字不同但必须能解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多触点归因与 Last-click 争议","id":"多触点归因与-last-click-争议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五种规则式模型及其失效方式","id":"核心概念-五种规则式模型及其失效方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Last-click 争议的三个层次","id":"last-click-争议的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"数据驱动模型：Shapley 值与马尔可夫链","id":"数据驱动模型-shapley-值与马尔可夫链"},{"level":2,"text":"跨网络去重：多网络并行的必然问题","id":"跨网络去重-多网络并行的必然问题"},{"level":2,"text":"增量实验：唯一能回答\"值不值\"的方法","id":"增量实验-唯一能回答-值不值-的方法"},{"level":2,"text":"落地建议：三层口径并行","id":"落地建议-三层口径并行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"点击归因与转化窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/tracking-attribution/click-attribution-window"},"next":{"title":"达人联盟计划与素材分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/kol-offsite/kol-affiliate-program"}}